## 3. GPIO Pinout Summary (ESP32-C3 0.42" OLED Board)

| GPIO | Function |
|------|----------|
| 4 | PC817 ring detector (INPUT_PULLUP, active LOW) |
| 2 | PhotoMOS door latch (OUTPUT, 2 s pulse) |
| 5 | OLED SDA |
| 6 | OLED SCL |
| 8 | Onboard blue LED (active LOW, optional) |
| 9 | BOOT button (not used in adapter firmware) |

**Not used in v1:** GPIO18 (melody), DS3231 RTC.

